# ============================================================
# prefilter.supercronic — schedule consumed by supercronic
#  (https://github.com/aptible/supercronic) inside the
#  bowaka-prefilter Docker container.
#
# Format is standard cron-5 (no user field, since supercronic
# runs as the container's USER directly). Per-line ``TZ=`` is
# a supercronic extension that lets each schedule resolve in
# America/Denver regardless of the container's TZ env (which
# the openalgo Dockerfile pins to UTC).
#
# 02:00 MT trigger with hourly retries through 06:00 MT
# (5 attempts total = 4-hour recovery window). The
# ``run_bowaka_prefilter.sh`` script is idempotent: a retry
# is a no-op when network was healthy on the first attempt
# because the prefilter only overwrites the candidate file
# when bars fetch successfully. When the network is broken
# at 02:00 (today's actual failure mode), supercronic fires
# again at 03:00 / 04:00 / 05:00 / 06:00 — first success wins.
# ============================================================
TZ=America/Denver 0 2,3,4,5,6 * * 1-5  /app/strategies/scripts/run_bowaka_prefilter.sh
